// Axiom Compiler — Bounded Translation Validation & Witness Checker (compiler/verify/translation_val/mod.ax)
// Implements SPEC-25 (AXS-PCT-020..024, AXS-PCT-050..053, INV-PCT-002):
//   - Five-tier Observable Semantic Equivalence hierarchy (Level 0 Structural, Level 1 Value,
//     Level 2 Memory & Resource, Level 3 Effect & Trap, Level 4 Observable Semantic Equivalence)
//     and per-function TranslationWitness records (AXS-PCT-020).
//   - Middle-end translation validation across MIR <-> OptIR scalar & algebraic rewrites
//     (exact bit-width, signed/unsigned polarity, IEEE-754 NaN/-0.0 rules, and checked-arithmetic
//     trap preservation NoOverflow/NonZero/ShiftInRange/InBounds), CFG canonicalization &
//     unreachable block removal (ReachableEdge, phi/MemoryPhi/dominance completeness), and
//     memory/loop transformations (DeadStore, MustAlias/NoAlias, SROA, LICM, BCE, preserving
//     volatile, atomic, Drop, and capability barriers) (AXS-PCT-021).
//   - Target legalization & register allocation witness validation (zero remaining vregs,
//     physical register unit RAX/EAX/AX/AL and XMMi/YMMi overlap checking with move-coalescing
//     provenance, dominating spill stores to dedicated stack slots without aliasing user/volatile
//     memory, fixed-register ISA constraints RCX/RAX:RDX, and caller/callee-save contracts) (AXS-PCT-022).
//   - Instruction scheduling dependency & barrier witness validation (topological preservation of
//     RAW/WAR/WAW dependencies on GPR/XMM/vector/stack/EFLAGS and strict ordering barriers for
//     aliasing memory, volatile/MMIO, atomic, fences, call, and trapping Assert/idiv/div) (AXS-PCT-023).
//   - Machine code finalization gate (allocated -> scheduled -> framed -> unwindable ->
//     security-valid -> encodable, 16-byte Win64 call-site RSP alignment, __chkstk on frames
//     >= 4096 bytes, Secret<T> zeroization barriers, and canonical .pdata/.xdata unwind match) (AXS-PCT-024).
//   - --validate-translations diagnostic reporting (AX_ICE_MIR_VERIFY / AX_ICE_INTERNAL with
//     data.stage = "translation_val") and deterministic inspect --emit=pass-witness output (AXS-PCT-050).
module compiler.verify.translation_val

